    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We invested in Medikabazaar in 2021, with a follow-on investment made in 2022. Our investment will help to streamline the medical supply chain in India, resulting in improved availability of various medical supplies, transparent pricing and lower search costs for small providers. In turn, such products and services will enable these providers to meet the health needs of smaller groups and communities that live beyond large cities.</narrative>
